# Open in VS Code with the "REST Client" extension and click "Send Request",
# or copy the curl equivalents from the handout.
@api = http://localhost:3000

### List events
GET {{api}}/events?category=workshop

### One event
GET {{api}}/events/2

### Create an event
POST {{api}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Pitch Night",
  "category": "social",
  "startsAt": "2026-12-01T18:00:00.000Z",
  "location": "Student Hall",
  "capacity": 50
}

### Invalid: expect 400 with one message per problem
POST {{api}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Hi", "capacity": 0, "booked": 99 }

### Book 2 seats
POST {{api}}/events/2/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Dara", "email": "dara@example.com", "seats": 2 }

### Too many seats: expect 409
POST {{api}}/events/2/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Dara", "email": "dara@example.com", "seats": 4 }

### Cancel booking 1
DELETE {{api}}/bookings/1
